**Thursday 8 October 2026, 11:00–12:30** · Salon 26+27, Hotel Nyborg Strand · D3A 4.0 2026
([session page](https://d3aconference.dk/supercomputing-challenges-agents/)).

Shared HPC is only worth it if researchers can actually get their work done on it. So we're
bringing HPC providers and researchers into the same room to talk about what gets in the way, and
to look at where agentic GenAI might help.

## About this session

